678:    M201 --> M201K["M2-01K keyed digest 基础"]
689:    M216B --> M208["M2-08 observe_terminal 触发与 generation job"]
694:    M212 --> M216C["M2-16C bridge memory.recall / episode.record"]
707:### 依赖登记表
